A vast night sky filled with countless twinkling stars in the style of Vincent van Gogh, with characteristic swirling brushstrokes in deep blues, purples, and golden yellows. In the foreground, a solitary figure sits at an antique wooden desk on a hillside, surrounded by dozens of floating, glowing puzzle pieces that drift upward and merge with the stars above. Each puzzle piece emanates a soft, different-colored light—emerald, amber, violet, cyan—representing collected treasures. The swirling cosmos above mirrors the chaotic yet beautiful arrangement of the floating pieces, suggesting an endless collection that rivals the infinite stars. Thick impasto texture throughout, with visible expressive brushwork creating movement and energy. The scene evokes wonder, obsessive gathering, and the joy of endless discovery.
